{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Down to the firstborn of the captive.</b> Why did the captives suffer? So that they should not say: their fear demanded its humiliation and brought punishment upon Egypt." "<b>From the firstborn of Pharaoh down to the firstborn of the maidservant.</b> All who were lesser than the firstborn of Pharaoh and greater than the firstborn of the maidservant were included; and why did the sons of the maidservants suffer? Because they too were enslaving them and rejoicing in their distress." "<b>And every firstborn of beast.</b> Because they worshipped it. When the Holy One, blessed be He, exacts retribution from a nation, He exacts retribution from its deity."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:51:27.429038652Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}